WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:02.300
Speaker 1: This is so funny.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:09.080
Donald Trump has been calling for protests
for days on the basis of his allegedly imminent

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.719
arrest and indictment.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:12.299
Trump has been saying protest, protest, protest.

00:00:12.299 --> 00:00:13.299
It is time.

00:00:13.299 --> 00:00:14.299
It is time.

00:00:14.299 --> 00:00:16.090
It is time to take the country back, etc..

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:22.380
Well, protesters did show up yesterday outside
of Trump Tower, except they were protesting

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.420
in favor of Trump getting arrested.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.940
This is just so funny.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.740
Trump screaming to anyone that will listen.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.010
You've got to go and protest.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.040
You've got to go and protest.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.950
There were protesters, but they had a sign
saying Trump is guilty.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.960
No one is above the law.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:44.540
Seditious conspiracy, lock Trump up, etc..

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.540
Take a look at this.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.540
Take a listen.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.500
Not exactly the protests Trump was looking
for.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.710
Speaker 2: Interestingly enough, we bring
you this live shot here.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:57.879
We know the former president has called for
four protests in a peaceful manner.

00:00:57.879 --> 00:00:59.590
Many Republicans push back on that.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:04.100
But interestingly enough, it's the opposite
side that's outside protesting now saying

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.650
insurrection, tick tock, time's up.

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:06.880
No one is above the law.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.000
Trump is guilty.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.650
Speaker 1: Sir.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.729
The protesters are here.

00:01:11.729 --> 00:01:12.759
Fantastic.

00:01:12.759 --> 00:01:13.759
What are the signs?

00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:14.759
Say, sir?

00:01:14.759 --> 00:01:15.940
They say to lock you up.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:21.119
Speaker 2: And many supporting the possible
indictment of former President Trump.

00:01:21.119 --> 00:01:22.119
There again, the.

00:01:22.119 --> 00:01:25.812
Speaker 1: Signs really look like they were
made by the grass roots.

00:01:25.812 --> 00:01:28.230
Grass roots groups do, don't they, John?

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.470
Speaker 2: Yeah, we'll continue to follow
that again.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:36.479
Speaker 1: And so this is a report from Newsmax,
by the way, the guest here suggesting the

00:01:36.479 --> 00:01:45.630
signs that are being held up are too professionally
made to really be actual activists grassroots

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:46.630
sign.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:50.399
Clearly there is someone behind it, and usually
the someone is George Soros.

00:01:50.399 --> 00:01:52.369
I mean, you have to understand the language.

00:01:52.369 --> 00:01:54.810
That's a dog whistle if I've ever seen one.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.600
Not exactly the protest that Donald Trump
was looking for.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.090
One more thing on protests, a group did.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:07.340
Gather in Florida yesterday outside of Mar
a Lago, and this was in West Palm Beach.

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:08.709
This is really funny.

00:02:08.709 --> 00:02:15.550
MSNBC interviewed a Trump supporter who was
at the protest and she says, we are not protesting.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:16.550
We're not.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.280
And by the way, if Trump's indicted, we're
not going to do anything seemingly wanting

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:25.780
to preempt any possibility of Trumpists being
accused of violence.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:30.100
She seems not to be liking this narrative
of where we are here, Chris.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.560
I want to just introduce you real fast to
one woman who we met.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:37.060
Debbie, you were telling me that you helped
look this online.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.030
What type of folks have you done this before?

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.516
Have you had you tried to get people out and
come out here before?

00:02:40.516 --> 00:02:45.010
Speaker 3: I just have a group of friends
and we are made and just get it out to some

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:48.280
and they get it out to some.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.880
And that's just how.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.700
Speaker 1: When you saw Donald Trump call
for a protest, what did that mean to you?

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:53.700
Protest.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:54.700
Speaker 3: We're not protesting.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:55.700
We're supporting the person president.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:56.700
Speaker 1: Not protest.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:02.780
And if he were to be invited, what should
the response be from supporters like you?

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:03.780
Speaker 3: Nothing.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.129
But just have a big party and laugh it off.

00:03:07.129 --> 00:03:08.360
Speaker 1: That's the best.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.989
Well, if so, what would people like you do?

00:03:10.989 --> 00:03:11.989
Nothing.

00:03:11.989 --> 00:03:12.989
We would celebrate the arrest.

00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:13.989
Speaker 3: It's ridiculous.

00:03:13.989 --> 00:03:15.580
Speaker 1: Whichever folks are here today.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:19.360
Speaker 3: Everyday, normal, everyday, hardworking
people.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.010
Speaker 1: There you go.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:30.840
Obviously very hardworking enough to be out
protesting at 1:09 p.m. on a Tuesday.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:35.670
As we know, that's notoriously a time when
hard working people are able to go and just

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:40.010
hold flags for a guy who lost a recent election
and simply can't accept that.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.000
So this is going to be super interesting.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:51.129
But I maintain right now when I take the temperature
of MAGA, I don't get the definitive feeling

00:03:51.129 --> 00:03:54.230
that they're ready to go and riot if and when
Trump is arrested.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.370
And I think that's a good thing.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:59.200
You know, a lot of right wingers write in
all the time and they say, David, you want

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.160
in order to get ratings and clicks, you want
there to be violence and that will allow you

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.650
to go after Trump supporters as being violent.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:06.650
And that's you.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:07.720
It's terrible that you want that.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.720
No, no, no.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.720
I don't want that.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.200
I don't want that at all.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:16.720
And in fact, if you go back to the January
six, 2021 Trump Trump livestream that we did

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.859
you see that?

00:04:18.859 --> 00:04:25.400
I don't exactly look thrilled when they breach
the Capitol and break in, despite the fact

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.300
that it did generate a lot of attention.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:32.770
I would rather what's better for the country,
which is for there not to be violent outbursts

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:38.000
as a result of the justice system carrying
forward and indicting when there is evidence

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.000
to do so.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.440
That's not an action that I want to see there
be violence in response to.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.620
So of course, we will be watching it.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:49.830
Latest rumor is maybe indictment today, but
Trump surrender next week or maybe nothing

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:50.830
will happen.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.080
We really don't know.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:55.479
But as soon as I know anything, you will as
well.

